<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
<section class="sand" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="kicker" data-anim="up">Before You Enquire</span><h2 data-anim="up" style="--d:.06s">The Questions Brands Ask First</h2></div>
    <div class="faq" data-anim="up">
      <details><summary>How far ahead do we need to plan?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Eight to ten weeks is comfortable for an Asia retreat and gives us room to secure the right creators and rates. We have turned trips around faster, but flight and hotel costs rise sharply inside six weeks and creator availability narrows.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Do we need to bring our own influencers?</summary><div class="ans"><p>No. We source, negotiate and manage the creators, and you approve the shortlist before anything is confirmed. If you already work with talent you like, we bring them into the trip instead.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Who owns the content afterwards?</summary><div class="ans"><p>You receive usage rights for one month on the Asia packages and three months on the international package. Extended or perpetual rights can be quoted upfront. Creator posts stay on creator accounts under the terms agreed in their contract.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>How do the customers get selected?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Usually through the spend and win mechanic, which is what makes the campaign pay for itself. It can also run as a loyalty reward, a top customer invite or a competition on your own channels. We design the mechanic with you.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What if our budget is under SGD 20,000?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Say so in the form. We run local influencer campaigns and content production without the travel component, and those start well below the retreat packages. We would rather scope something that works than push you into a trip.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can we send our own team instead of customers?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Some brands use the same structure for a staff or partner retreat with content production attached. The logistics and crew are identical, only the mechanic changes.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Is FLYCO a licensed travel operator?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Retreats are operated by Flyco Business Pte. Ltd. together with I Quadrant Travel Pte. Ltd. under Travel Licence No. TA03759.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== FORM ===== -->
<section id="enquire">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="form-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker" data-anim="up">Enquire</span>
        <h2 data-anim="up" style="--d:.06s">Tell Us The Objective. We Will Send The Numbers.</h2>
        <p data-anim="up" style="--d:.12s;color:var(--grey);margin-top:14px">No pitch deck ambush. You get a scoped proposal with a real cost, a creator shortlist and the exact content you would receive.</p>
        <ul class="mini-list" data-anim="up" style="--d:.18s">
          <li>Reply within one business day</li>
          <li>Costed proposal within three to five business days</li>
          <li>No commitment until the scope is signed off</li>
          <li>Singapore and Malaysia based team</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="gal g3" data-anim="up" style="gap:10px;--d:.24s">
          <div class="shot sq reveal"><img src="{{ 'people-interview.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Customer testimonial interview on location"></div>
          <div class="shot sq reveal"><img src="{{ 'people-customers.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Customers on a FLYCO retreat"></div>
          <div class="shot sq reveal"><img src="{{ 'onsite-beach.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Branded beach activation"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form id="enquiryForm" novalidate data-anim="up">
        <div class="fields">
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Full name <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Jane Tan" required><span class="err-msg">Please enter your name.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="company">Company <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company name" required><span class="err-msg">Please enter your company.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="email">Work email <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="jane@company.com" required><span class="err-msg">Please enter a valid work email.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="phone">WhatsApp or phone <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+65 8000 0000" required><span class="err-msg">Please enter a contact number.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="interest">What you want to run <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <select id="interest" name="interest" required>
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option>Brand tailored retreat, Asia</option>
              <option>Brand tailored retreat, international</option>
              <option>Pure creators retreat</option>
              <option>Spend and win campaign</option>
              <option>Local influencer campaign only</option>
              <option>Not sure yet, advise us</option>
            </select><span class="err-msg">Please choose an option.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="budget">Indicative budget <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <select id="budget" name="budget" required>
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option>Under SGD 20,000</option>
              <option>SGD 20,000 to 30,000</option>
              <option>SGD 30,000 to 50,000</option>
              <option>Above SGD 50,000</option>
              <option>Not confirmed yet</option>
            </select><span class="err-msg">Please choose a range.</span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="timing">Target travel window</label>
            <select id="timing" name="timing">
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option>Within 3 months</option>
              <option>3 to 6 months</option>
              <option>More than 6 months</option>
              <option>Still exploring</option>
            </select></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="destination">Preferred destination</label><input type="text" id="destination" name="destination" placeholder="Bali, Ho Chi Minh, open to ideas"></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="message">What is the campaign for</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Product launch, retail push, content library for Q4, customer loyalty. Anything that helps us scope it properly."></textarea></div>
          <input type="hidden" name="utm_source" id="utm_source"><input type="hidden" name="utm_medium" id="utm_medium">
          <input type="hidden" name="utm_campaign" id="utm_campaign"><input type="hidden" name="utm_content" id="utm_content">
          <input type="hidden" name="utm_term" id="utm_term"><input type="hidden" name="gclid" id="gclid">
          <input type="hidden" name="fbclid" id="fbclid"><input type="hidden" name="landing_page" id="landing_page">
          <input type="hidden" name="referrer" id="referrer">
          <input type="text" name="company_website" id="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;opacity:0;height:0;width:0">
        </div>
        <div class="consent"><input type="checkbox" id="consent" name="consent" required><label for="consent">I agree to FLYCO contacting me about this enquiry by email, phone or WhatsApp.</label></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block"><span>Send My Enquiry</span></button>
        <p class="form-foot">We reply within one business day. Your details are never sold or shared.</p>
        <div class="thanks" role="status"><div class="tick"></div><h3>Enquiry received</h3><p>Thanks. Our team will be in touch within one business day with next steps and a few questions to scope your proposal.</p></div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

